    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BotKill</strong> is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where you face off against endless waves of deadly bots. Are you able to\u00a0survive, upgrade, and destroy\u00a0on a battlefield overrun by ruthless war machines?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.poster.avif?t=1754853320\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.webm?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.mp4?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw yourself into intense, fast-paced combat against relentless bots and towering bosses. Use strategic positioning to stay alive and unleash a devastating bullet-hell</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT AND UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather debris from destroyed enemies and use it to upgrade your armor, or deploy automated gun turrets and rotating pikes to turn the tide of battle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENHANCE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy items to unleash devastating blasts, or activate random enhancements that boost your abilities. Adapt your strategy based on the situation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC BATTLEFIELD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is unpredictable. Random obstacles crash down from above, creating cover or hazards. The floor can rise unexpectedly, altering movement paths and forcing you to stay on your toes. No two battles play out the same way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.poster.avif?t=1754853320\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.webm?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.mp4?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE BULLET HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face progressively tougher waves of enemies, each introducing new threats. Adapt to an ever-changing battleground where quick reflexes and tactical thinking are key to survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE APPRECIATE YOUR SUPPORT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this game caught your interest, please support us and add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong>! Thank you very much!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BotKill</strong> is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where you face off against endless waves of deadly bots. Are you able to\u00a0survive, upgrade, and destroy\u00a0on a battlefield overrun by ruthless war machines?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.poster.avif?t=1754853320\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.webm?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/e88b209cb59ecb04a1bdbff8c329c4ad.mp4?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw yourself into intense, fast-paced combat against relentless bots and towering bosses. Use strategic positioning to stay alive and unleash a devastating bullet-hell</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT AND UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather debris from destroyed enemies and use it to upgrade your armor, or deploy automated gun turrets and rotating pikes to turn the tide of battle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENHANCE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy items to unleash devastating blasts, or activate random enhancements that boost your abilities. Adapt your strategy based on the situation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC BATTLEFIELD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is unpredictable. Random obstacles crash down from above, creating cover or hazards. The floor can rise unexpectedly, altering movement paths and forcing you to stay on your toes. No two battles play out the same way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.poster.avif?t=1754853320\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.webm?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555040/extras/d287e3881389a1b0fa1848d55280ae0d.mp4?t=1754853320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE BULLET HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face progressively tougher waves of enemies, each introducing new threats. Adapt to an ever-changing battleground where quick reflexes and tactical thinking are key to survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE APPRECIATE YOUR SUPPORT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this game caught your interest, please support us and add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong>! Thank you very much!</p>",
